        "TileImage": "$($repository 052434e7-f451-462f-a9d7-13657cb047c0).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47, your targets are Viktor Novikov and Dalia Margolis. Nobody has told me why you need to kill them but you do. Also make sure you use the Xmas star because I told you to. And please, for the love of god, ignore Santa Claus. I know you&apos;ve always said it was you dream to &quot;Kill Saint Nick and wear his big red suit&quot; but you are a professional. That is all 47. Notify me when it is done.",
